===============================================================================
NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE
===============================================================================

This software is a research and demonstration artifact. It is NOT a medical
device, has NOT been validated for clinical use, and carries NO regulatory
clearance or approval of any kind in any jurisdiction.

It must not be used to plan, guide, inform, or document the care of any
patient. Output of this software — including measurements, implant sizes,
resection depths, component positions, cutting guides, and reports — is not
suitable for clinical decision-making and must not be represented as such.

The software is published so that the methods behind computer-assisted
arthroplasty planning can be inspected, reproduced, criticised, and built
upon. That purpose is served by openness, not by clinical deployment.

Every plan file produced by this software carries an `intended_use` field
recording this restriction, and every generated report carries it in the
header. Do not remove them.

